flowchart TD
  UI[Medical page] --> Query[Read path from URL query]
  Query --> List[POST dir to medical.php]
  List --> Scan[scandir supplied directory]
  Scan --> Names[Return filenames]
  UI --> Select[Select file]
  Select --> Upload[POST file and path to upload.php]
  Upload --> Check[Extension, MIME and size checks]
  Check --> Store[Write file to supplied target directory]
